<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 200-3 V AUSTRALIA (118) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 200-3 V AUSTRALIA (118) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 200-3 in reply to Australia's first innings of 118 at the close on the first day of the first test at Edgbaston on Thursday.</p>
</text>
